{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "96b0ae0fa2374c8830d0027cf672f2b369e34bc4ee83401bf19bf22320da8929", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです、お待ちしてましたよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了，我一直在等您哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5cb4db5f6febe9e338d0fe506c43c707b1c0e98c7b511e11019ceefaddfbb1b4", "ja": "おや、青羽さん。お疲れさまです！\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "哎呀，青羽小姐。辛苦了！怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "3b125234840300e51bc438db6010b7a826a361051bf7e678cf0ebfef46b138fb", "ja": "これ、どうぞ！\n今日のおやつの、肉まんです♪", "zh": "这个，请收下！\n这是今天的点心——肉包♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_1003", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b55b03345b3be338a9a9a9da1857ec387d6c0143aba1f39f8127d8e2e40c81d6", "ja": "おっ、ありがとうございます！\n最近寒いですからね、温かさが身にしみます。", "zh": "哦，谢谢您！\n最近天气很冷，这份温暖真是沁入身心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2001_102mis", "source_sha256": "d72b35f5a72f1d17990e44d96b832c5614f165f82a4e1fa61553fc901354bcbf", "ja": "頑張って、肉まん……頑張って……！", "zh": "加油啊，肉包……加油……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c054c266bfa3a581b3fdca5d5c1eb6878a2b7363f7eb00ef37841b1b7d8cf4a5", "ja": "……？　青羽さん？", "zh": "……？青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2003_102mis", "source_sha256": "8c4527f9a13c51fb2aabcc821db384884ae5aad9f25de094e49a2ed9d24513d8", "ja": "い、いえ、なんでもないです……えへへ。\nあっ、それと、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "不、不是，没什么……嘿嘿。\n啊，还有，社长叫您过去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "38fff098a70ae8748087df38af1cbf1320597454d709cbdf4bd62d51bc620c49", "ja": "そうなんですか！　それでは、\n肉まんをいただいたら、さっそく行ってみますね。", "zh": "这样啊！那我吃完肉包，就马上过去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2005_102mis", "source_sha256": "2436ab66c47c118566ddd85289fc1df2f5b286cff53a13bde5daafd022a6b385", "ja": "はーい♪　すっごく熱いので、\n慌てないで召し上がってくださいね！", "zh": "好——♪　特别烫的，\n请不要着急，慢慢吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "048f5621dbe06c458b2b9148bb65397b162cf9e048941382733d9e9d1f76e487", "ja": "はい、それでは……あちちっ！？　あちっ！", "zh": "好，那么接下来……烫烫的！？好烫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "3a715abb11095e290573a4874b6015105cc2e12c004ef892c16ef664b0088ccf", "ja": "失礼します！\n社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "打扰了！\n社长、音无小姐，两位辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2009_president", "source_sha256": "153ca32ae4836f6dcfed7ebb67ee7387439fd0cf47bc1ac61574f60f04ebdcba", "ja": "おお君か、お疲れさま！\nわざわざすまなかったね。", "zh": "哦，是你啊，辛苦了！\n特意麻烦你跑一趟，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2010_101kot", "source_sha256": "24db4a8b06d2c321334d1529216acf6b9fb08d43cd863ffc523a21d4a4d26b7e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n外、寒かったですよね。大丈夫でしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n外面很冷吧。没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2011_p", "source_sha256": "115e23db0d5b0aaa0496d241752485ecbb2a80e35377fc460b49f6905e174b00", "ja": "ええ、ホカホカなので平気です！\nそれより社長、何かお話があるとか？", "zh": "嗯，我热乎乎的，没事！\n比起这个，听说社长您有事要谈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2012_president", "source_sha256": "57cac64d8589a45b8efefcbaee7c93017426372632f6558875d8d3416b980f6c", "ja": "うむ。早速だが、君の企画書を読ませてもらったよ。\n次の天体公演……実に結構じゃないか！", "zh": "嗯。言归正传，我看了你的策划书。\n接下来的天体公演……真的很不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2013_p", "source_sha256": "35d38ca4498aefbd3d4b560cc8956eccfe3337e4e4460c0ce39fbfab3bcddb42", "ja": "おおっ、そう言ってくれるという事は……。\nやらせてもらえるんですか！？", "zh": "哦哦，你能这么说，也就是说……可以让我们来做吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2014_president", "source_sha256": "26fd8c8caf5605a006b82b3794fce106037005cd2bcbca5e03ce13bb7e6d5542", "ja": "うむ！　是非やってもらいたいと思っている。\nそこで、だ。企画書によると……。", "zh": "嗯！我非常希望你能做这件事。\n所以说，根据企划书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2015_president", "source_sha256": "059fdff57ca7d8793a2540463c2bd4e498cbe6b9e9009f195bcef0281df95e32", "ja": "切ない曲で冬の寒さを暖めたい、という事だったね？\nそれを読んで、ピーン！　と来たよ。", "zh": "你说过，想用一首伤感的歌来温暖冬日的寒冷，对吧？\n读到这句话，我一下子就有主意了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2016_president", "source_sha256": "046d507737359f007298301e2c10d012820e5294397c55341c2408f3da90fe44", "ja": "まずは、この曲を聴いてくれたまえ……音無君！", "zh": "首先，请听听这首歌吧……音无君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2017_101kot", "source_sha256": "e0f33d1e25e3bf489665bd123950fc215855f86b3460c7abce128eb108509f38", "ja": "はい、社長！　ぽちっ。", "zh": "好的，社长！点一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2019_p", "source_sha256": "6ea97fcd5af231b812758c2dfbe420809049562b20625bc963a02cfd1336f362", "ja": "こ、これは……切ない……！\n今までの楽曲の中でも、トップレベルの切なさです。", "zh": "这、这也太令人心酸了……\n在至今为止的歌曲中，也是最让人心酸的之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2020_101kot", "source_sha256": "f9d37a05d8a9e5338524eccaa183200afe62732bf494c35ff1f64cc94aadf81e", "ja": "素敵な曲ですよね……聞いてるだけで、\nなんだか胸が締め付けられるみたいで……はぁ。", "zh": "真是一首动听的歌呢……光是听着，就感觉心口像被揪紧了一样……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2021_president", "source_sha256": "e8cef61a0fe0a0bb51c4aacac41b7add259f7ca66b15e6b1f203a64b5cf9de29", "ja": "天体公演の新曲として、用意させてもらったんだが……\nこのとおり、想像以上に切ない曲になってしまった。", "zh": "虽说是作为天体公演的新曲准备的……\n但如你所见，曲子变得比想象中还要令人伤感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2022_president", "source_sha256": "ae383cfd8f42ac1156d49ebf01d200ac0a00af460cc2f7766444e5a91629dccb", "ja": "このレベルに切ない曲だと、\n歌いこなすのには、苦労するかもしれないね……はぁ。", "zh": "这么伤感的歌，要唱好它可能会很辛苦呢……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2023_p", "source_sha256": "4b1d9d82ad8f485a0e62e2c2b85cb4584710d25d1e1a10cbdaba807f4d39a38d", "ja": "はい、難しいかもしれません……。\nでもだからこそ、挑戦しがいがあると思います！", "zh": "是的，可能会很难……不过正因为如此，才更值得挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2024_president", "source_sha256": "de6830a3ee2c77720dff5fc419cebd0be98bd42197ebf1528133ac1eb23f8062", "ja": "おお、頼もしい言葉だ！\nでは、人選から君に任せようじゃないか。", "zh": "哦，这话真让人安心！\n那么，人选就交给你来决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2025_p", "source_sha256": "e73ffcc0b4f2ea2578e66dc0c798d70adae316b85cc1b456bef23da49ffaa786", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n人選……確かにメンバーは重要ですね。うーん……。", "zh": "谢谢。\n挑选人选……成员确实很重要。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2026_president", "source_sha256": "d4a16e0164bc8192c160fe27cbcbeaed85392fd176cf91e7e7608bb4b392a0d1", "ja": "この曲の世界をガッチリ掴んでくれるような、\nそんな子たちがいいと思うんだが……。", "zh": "我觉得还是选那些能牢牢抓住这首歌世界观的孩子比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2027_101kot", "source_sha256": "d79c32d136baeab7894250fda2debddbe66129d1f25b37b8ff1912e1aa189e2f", "ja": "大人っぽくて、歌に想いを乗せられるような……\nそんなユニットだったら、泣けちゃいそうですね！", "zh": "成熟大人感，又能把心意融入歌声里的……\n要是组成这样的组合，感觉都要感动得哭出来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2028_p", "source_sha256": "6cc04287faa16c9929963666495887a522f3e05360309b6a6b3bf86456914827", "ja": "なるほど、大人っぽいユニットですか……。", "zh": "原来如此，是成熟风格的组合吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2029_president", "source_sha256": "495c7780cc8177d0220825ad54e66f3386a08f3f17eef5048a9b467ba9312d25", "ja": "ちなみに、君のイメージだと、\nやはり大人のメンバーになってくるかい？", "zh": "顺便问一下，按照你的印象，果然会是成年成员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2030_p", "source_sha256": "6e603d3b99bce19bfbd6417d1233f59e2b8daf7eb24227a88034cc2177baf436", "ja": "そうですね、確かに大人組も手堅いですが……。\n今回は少し、幅を持たせてみようかなと思います。", "zh": "是啊，确实成熟组也很稳妥，不过……\n这次我想或许可以稍微拓宽一下范围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2031_president", "source_sha256": "ac3b20c1c81534d4687f8aaaada84c536bc8c0585f28518f797feaddfe76493b", "ja": "ほう！　なにか考えがあるみたいだね。\nふむふむ、楽しみだ！", "zh": "哦！看来你有什么想法呢。\n嗯嗯，真让人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2032_president", "source_sha256": "209fdce30e0e194ceedf4ae832e6bc9fb43e28b157d408ec7e61f58ade927e0e", "ja": "いずれにせよ、君に任せたよ。\nこの冬一番、話題の公演にしてくれるね？", "zh": "无论如何，就交给你了。\n你会让它成为这个冬天最具话题性的演出吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_2033", "source_sha256": "1ef3b4237393d43344e96752a7d765bbe7391f2c9401bbed27028496740ef32b", "ja": "します！", "zh": "会做的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_intro_3000_p", "source_sha256": "215df69c75251db51c8aeb8c8b3d7296a6287062804be010f1bdd8a54f31a494", "ja": "任せてください。\nアイドル達と一緒に、最高のステージにしてみせます！", "zh": "请交给我吧。\n我一定会和偶像们一起，把舞台呈现得最精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
